{"4964640":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Infested DX","steam_appid":4964640,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5310060,5421320],"detailed_description":"<h1>Available on Steam Deck!<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/31a93c09a19849b174c65238a6b14eb6.avif?t=1793717627\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras_big\/31a93c09a19849b174c65238a6b14eb6.webp?t=1793717627 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Adventure Gameplay<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic point n click gameplay lets you examine and interact with everything to find creative solutions and solve every puzzle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dae3945aab73ca29ff429bd051ece23a.poster.avif?t=1793717627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dae3945aab73ca29ff429bd051ece23a.webm?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dae3945aab73ca29ff429bd051ece23a.mp4?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Detailed Pixel Art<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presented in a glorious retro pixel art style, Infested DX picks up right where the classic first-person adventure games of the 80s and 90s left off, but with even more animations and dynamic elements. Explore the infested starship and visit alien worlds filled with items, objects and danger around every turn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/4895060df834aebca382d3974fbcb7cf.avif?t=1793717627\" width=1170 height=500 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Die Fast, Die Often<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wrong move is all it takes to die. But dying is all part of the game! You never lose progress when dying and you are encouraged to experiment and try anything.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/72c15fb77d2d5cb778f9a1a15cd9752b.poster.avif?t=1793717627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/72c15fb77d2d5cb778f9a1a15cd9752b.webm?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/72c15fb77d2d5cb778f9a1a15cd9752b.mp4?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Inventory<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take everything you can and put what you find to use or craft something even more useful. Creative thinking and resourcefulness will save your life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dea54a92f3f6e73db4d72e815cfc682e.poster.avif?t=1793717627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dea54a92f3f6e73db4d72e815cfc682e.webm?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dea54a92f3f6e73db4d72e815cfc682e.mp4?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Adventure Gameplay<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic point n click gameplay lets you examine and interact with everything to find creative solutions and solve every puzzle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dae3945aab73ca29ff429bd051ece23a.poster.avif?t=1793717627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dae3945aab73ca29ff429bd051ece23a.webm?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dae3945aab73ca29ff429bd051ece23a.mp4?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Detailed Pixel Art<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presented in a glorious retro pixel art style, Infested DX picks up right where the classic first-person adventure games of the 80s and 90s left off, but with even more animations and dynamic elements. Explore the infested starship and visit alien worlds filled with items, objects and danger around every turn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/4895060df834aebca382d3974fbcb7cf.avif?t=1793717627\" width=1170 height=500 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Die Fast, Die Often<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wrong move is all it takes to die. But dying is all part of the game! You never lose progress when dying and you are encouraged to experiment and try anything.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/72c15fb77d2d5cb778f9a1a15cd9752b.poster.avif?t=1793717627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/72c15fb77d2d5cb778f9a1a15cd9752b.webm?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/72c15fb77d2d5cb778f9a1a15cd9752b.mp4?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Inventory<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take everything you can and put what you find to use or craft something even more useful. Creative thinking and resourcefulness will save your life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dea54a92f3f6e73db4d72e815cfc682e.poster.avif?t=1793717627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dea54a92f3f6e73db4d72e815cfc682e.webm?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/extras\/dea54a92f3f6e73db4d72e815cfc682e.mp4?t=1793717627\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Escape a space nightmare as the sole survivor of an alien infestation. Search for clues and solve puzzles as you avoid deadly encounters with zombies, mutants, robots and unseen alien pathogens. Find a cure and a way home in this retro point and click adventure!","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/0ac57f7fa241b13d8cf1b51114ebc70105014423\/header.jpg?t=1793717627","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/f877766162d40c9d52252a50bbbf2870d5f7a16b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793717627","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964640\/f877766162d40c9d52252a50bbbf2870d5f7a16b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793717627","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 64-bit Dual Core CPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 4 or DirectX 11 compatible graphics card<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 50 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 64-bit Dual Core CPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 4 or DirectX 11 compatible graphics card<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 50 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Komi Games Inc.","GrahfMetal"],"publishers":["Komi Games Inc."],"demos":[{"appid":5310060,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":999,"final":799,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$9.99","final_formatted":"$7.99"},"packages":[1722771],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Infested DX","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","su